    "why": [
      "Saves 57% irrigation water (1148 mm/yr \u2014 ~15 flood irrigations and 631 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 0.6 cm/yr.",
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 72/100 (+12 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by +1.3 t C/ha, saving 4.1 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 34-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 138 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 44.1 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9273,539/ha (\u20b9110,698/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b9255,853/ha (\u20b9103,540/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: Tamil Nadu Kalaignarin Rice Fallow Pulses Mission (100% certified seed subsidy); Tamil Nadu Sustainable Dryland & Water Conservation Mission."
